The SBP does not exist. Do you mean CBP? A CBP competency score is awarded upon completion of a Competency Building Product (CBP) and its associated assessments. It reflects your performance on those assessments and contributes to your Total Competency Score (TCS), which represents your overall competency level on the platform. To acquire a competency, you must pass the corresponding assessment with the minimum required score.

