LLM Response:
-----------------------------------------------------------
Text:
A CBP competency score is a mark awarded to a learner upon completion of a Competency Building Product (CBP) and its associated assessments. This score is based on the learner's performance on those assessments and contributes to the TCS (Total Competency Score), which forms an individual's overall competency score. Assessments will be linked to each competency, and only upon passing the assessments with the minimum required score will you be able to acquire the competency and add it to your competency list.

